# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Without VITE_MRX_API_KEY the game uses the offline mock simulation.
#
# !!! TEMPORARY - REMOVE BEFORE RELEASE !!!
# The key is compiled into the JS bundle and readable by anyone who loads the
# page. Only for local testing; to be replaced by OAuth (src/services/mrx/config.ts).
VITE_MRX_API_KEY=

# Optional, defaults to the public MRX gateway.
# VITE_MRX_URL=https://mrx-org--mcp-gateway-func.modal.run/mcp
